6. Also write the full review to /tmp/codex-pr-453-review.md

If no Task trailer exists, proceed with pure code review (skip AC checks).

Severity levels: MUST-FIX, SHOULD-FIX, SUGGESTION.

Do NOT use REQUEST_CHANGES event — use COMMENT for findings or APPROVE when clean.
