      "line": 300,
      "body": "MUST-FIX: `saveTriageRecord()` upserts by `inbox_ref` and preserves the existing `_ulid`/`created_at` when a record already exists for the inbox item (`src/parser/yaml.ts`). This handler still returns and broadcasts the freshly generated `record._ulid`, so a second POST can persist one record but emit a different (nonexistent) ULID. Reload/use the persisted record identity before commit/broadcast/response."
    },
    {
